    "preamble": "Narla Laxmana Rao vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 11 November, 2019 The Honourable Sri Justice D.V.S.S. Somayajulu Criminal Petition No.6488 of 2019 Order:",
    "facts": "This Criminal Petition is filed by the petitioner under Section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure to quash the proceedings against the petitioner, in FIR No.218 of 2018 on the file of Station House Officer of Chodavaram Police-Station.",
